@ 3:28  style A fill: red, fill-o|pacity: 0.2, stroke: blue, stroke-width: 3, color: #fff, font: x
  3:22-3:34 "fill-opacity"
  | **`fill-opacity`**
  |
  | How opaque a set's fill is, from 0 to 1 (0.1 when not given), as in `fill-opacity: 0.3`.
